<speak>Thank you, Melissa. It was helpful to have a proper conversation without interruptions. I think I'll close the computer now instead of drifting straight into the inbox. My wife should be back soon, and we can have tea together before I go outside. There are a few leaves to sweep up, but I'll try not to turn that into a plan to rearrange the whole balcony. That would defeat the purpose of having a quieter afternoon.</speak>